msgid "In this video (24:05), Marie Grosjean, GBIF Data Administrator, provides an introduction the GBIF API. If you are unable to watch the embedded Vimeo video, you can download it locally on the xref:downloads.adoc[Files for download] page."
msgstr "在這段影片（24:05）中，GBIF 資料管理員 Marie Grosjean 針對 GBIF API 進行了介紹。若您無法觀看嵌入的 Vimeo 影片，可至 xref:downloads.adoc[可下載檔案] 頁面將影片下載至本機。"

